{ "Disable tracking of CreateRenderTargetView\nThis might help filtering of wrong HUDless resources", "停止跟踪 CreateRenderTargetView，可能帮助排除错误的无 HUD 候选资源。" },
{ "Disable tracking of CreateShaderResourceView\nThis might help filtering of wrong HUDless resources", "停止跟踪 CreateShaderResourceView，可能帮助排除错误的无 HUD 候选资源。" },
{ "Disable tracking of CreateUnorderedAccessView\nThis might help filtering of wrong HUDless resources", "停止跟踪 CreateUnorderedAccessView，可能帮助排除错误的无 HUD 候选资源。" },
{ "Disable tracking of Dispatch\nThis might help filtering of wrong HUDless resources", "停止跟踪 Dispatch，可能帮助排除错误的无 HUD 候选资源。" },
{ "Disable tracking of DrawIndexedInstanced\nThis might help filtering of wrong HUDless resources", "停止跟踪 DrawIndexedInstanced，可能帮助排除错误的无 HUD 候选资源。" },
