{ "Disable tracking of SetComputeRootDescriptorTable\nThis might help filtering of wrong HUDless resources", "停止跟踪 SetComputeRootDescriptorTable，可能帮助排除错误的无 HUD 候选资源。" },
{ "Disable tracking of SetGraphicsRootDescriptorTable\nThis might help filtering of wrong HUDless resources", "停止跟踪 SetGraphicsRootDescriptorTable，可能帮助排除错误的无 HUD 候选资源。" },
{ "The whole pass: the staging copies and the resolve as well as the\nmodel. Timing only the model would flatter the number.\n\nCompare it against the frame time at the bottom of this window to\nsee what it is costing you.", "此数值包含整个流程的耗时：暂存复制、模型运行与结果合成。\n可与窗口底部的帧耗时比较，以判断实际性能开销。" },
{ "Synthesises detail in the upscaler's output, before frame generation sees it.\n\nNeeds two similarly named files beside OptiScaler, one character apart:\n  nvngx_dlssnr.dll       NVIDIA's model (~165 MB) -- you supply it\n  nvngx.dll_dlssnr.dll   the forwarder (~13 KB) -- ships in this package\nUndocumented and driven directly, so none of this is officially supported.", "在超分辨率输出中生成细节，再交给帧生成。\n需要两个名称相近的文件：\nnvngx_dlssnr.dll：NVIDIA 模型，约 165 MB，需另外提供；\nnvngx.dll_dlssnr.dll：转发桥，由本组件包提供。\n此功能通过未公开接口调用，不属于官方支持的功能。" },
{ "Whether the model's edit is applied. Off shows the clean upscaler frame while the\npass keeps running -- so with Hold frame (under Compare) you can freeze a\nframe and toggle this to see the same frozen frame with and without Neural\nRendering. Leave it on for normal use.", "控制是否应用模型效果。关闭时显示未经模型修改的超分画面，模型仍继续运行。\n可配合“冻结画面”比较同一帧开启前后的效果，正常使用时保持开启。" },
{ "The filter that averages the model's above-native answer back to display size --\nthis is what turns supersampling into LESS noise rather than more. Sharper\nfilters (Lanczos3, Kaiser3) keep the most detail; softer ones (Bicubic,\nCatmull-Rom) are gentler on ringing. Independent of the Output Scaling\ndownscaler, so the two can differ and run at the same time.", "将高于显示分辨率的模型结果降采样。Lanczos3 / Kaiser3 保留更多细节；\nBicubic / Catmull-Rom 更柔和，振铃较少。\n此选项与“输出缩放”中的降采样器独立，可同时使用不同设置。" },
{ "What fraction of the frame the model works at. Cost falls with the square of\nthis, so half resolution is roughly a quarter of the time.\n\nThe frame is never reduced. Only the model's contribution is computed small\nand enlarged, so the picture underneath is untouched whatever this says.\n\nWhat it trades: the shading the model adds is broad and survives enlargement;\nthe fine structure it synthesises does not, and softens. Worth having when the\npass costs more than you want to pay for the detail it returns.\n\nThe frame itself stays at full detail whatever this says -- only the\nmodel's own work is done small.", "模型的工作分辨率，成本大致随分辨率倍率的平方变化；半分辨率约需四分之一耗时。\n原始画面保持完整分辨率，只缩小计算模型效果，再将效果放大合成。\n低分辨率会损失模型生成的细小结构，较宽的光照变化通常仍能保留。" },
{ "How the model's work is brought back up when it ran below the frame's size.\n\nClassic composes the model's small picture directly against the full-size\nframe. Those two disagree by the shrink's blur as well as by the model's edit,\nand the composition cannot tell them apart -- it reads the blur as brightness\nthe frame has and the model never saw. The lower the model resolution the\nlarger that error, and it is the colour shift that shows up at 50%.\n\nMatched residual carries up only the model's difference and lays it on the\nframe's own proxy, so both pictures being compared are full size and the only\nthing that came from the small raster is the edit itself.\n\nNo effect at 100% or above: there is no residual to carry and the two are\nidentical (supersampling brings its answer down to frame size before this).\n\nFrom hhkbble's multi-pass work on this fork.", "模型以低分辨率运行时，选择如何放大其效果。\n经典：直接将模型的小图与全分辨率画面合成，可能将缩小产生的模糊误当成亮度差异，尤其在 50% 时产生色偏。\n匹配残差：仅放大模型造成的差异，再合成到原图的代理图像，避免上述误差。\n100% 及更高分辨率时，两者相同。此功能来自 hhkbble 的多通道工作。" },
{ "How far the frame moves toward the model's picture.\n\nThe model's answer is not added to the frame -- it is a complete picture of its\nown, rescaled so its luminance sits where the original says it should. This\nblends between the two, so both ends are real pictures and everything between\nthem is one too.\n\n0 gives back exactly what the upscaler produced. 1 is the model's picture.\n\nAbove 1 carries on past it in the same direction, which is not something the\nmodel asked for -- use it to see what it is doing, then come back down. This\nis the control to push if you want more effect: Intensity belongs to the model\nand it decides what to do with it.", "在原始超分画面与模型生成画面之间插值。\n0：保留超分输出；1：完整模型效果。\n大于 1 会沿相同方向进一步夸张效果，建议用于观察后再调低。\n若想增加可见效果，优先调整本项；模型强度属于模型内部的另一项参数。" },
{ "Whether the model's colour arrives with its light.\n\n0 keeps the game's own hue exactly -- every pixel is the original colour with\nonly its brightness carrying the model's verdict. Game-accurate colour, with\nthe detail. 1 brings the model's colour as well, in its own hue, clamped into\nAP1 so nothing unreachable is asked for.\n\nThis cannot shift hue on its own: it interpolates between two finished\npictures rather than adding a colour difference to one, which is what used to\nlet a warm subject come back green.\n\nAbove 1 it OVER-SATURATES: the colour keeps its hue but grows more vivid,\nand rolls off at the edge of what the display can show rather than clipping\ninto a flat blown patch. 1 is the model's own colour; push past it for punch.", "控制是否同时采用模型的色彩。\n0：保留游戏色相，仅使用模型对亮度的修改；1：采用模型的完整色彩。\n大于 1 会提高饱和度，并在显示色域边缘平滑收敛。\n通过两张完整图像插值，避免直接叠加色差产生错误色偏。" },
{ "What the model is shown, and how its answer comes back.\n\nOff (soft knee): the default. It rolls highlights off so hard the model\ncannot resolve detail in them -- fine in soft-lit scenes, weak in bright ones.\n\nNeutwo composed: an unclipped curve so the model sees highlight detail, then\neverything above (Detail/Colour strength, highlight guard, palette). It wins in\nbright scenes, but the curve compresses MIDTONES too, so in soft-lit content it\ncan be worse than Off. It also shifts paper white -- re-check it when you switch.\n\nHybrid composed: the best of both, and the one to use. Identity in the\nmidtones -- as good as Off there -- and the unclipped roll only in the\nhighlights, so it recovers the detail Off crushes without giving up the\nmidtones Neutwo does. It barely shifts paper white.\n\nReplace: the raw model straight back through the exact inverse, none of the\ncomposition -- no guard, no palette, no strengths. Gorgeous where there are no\nbright lights, but they FLASH in motion. A reference, not a daily setting.\n\nHybrid replace: the raw model like Replace, but on the hybrid curve -- the\ndecode is identity in the midtones, so the flashing is confined to genuine\nbright highlights instead of everywhere. Most of Replace's detail, far more\nstable. If you love the Replace look but the flicker bothers you, use this.\n\nOff is byte-identical to before.", "控制模型输入的亮度映射，以及输出的还原和合成。\n关闭（柔和拐点）：原默认行为，高光压缩较强，明亮场景可能丢失细节。\nNeutwo 合成：保留高光细节，但也压缩中间调；切换后请重新检查纸白值。\n混合合成：中间调保持原值，仅压缩高光，较好平衡细节和稳定性。\n替换：直接反向映射原始模型输出，绕过强度、调色和高光保护，运动中的高光可能闪烁，仅建议作为参考。\n混合替换：使用混合曲线进行替换，中间调更稳定，但明亮高光仍可能闪烁。\n关闭时沿用原有逐字节一致的行为。" },
{ "Default leaves the choice to the model.\n\nNot the same scale as the super resolution or ray reconstruction presets --\nthe same number means something different here.", "默认由模型决定预设。\n此处的编号与超分辨率、光线重建预设无关，相同数字不代表相同含义。" },
{ "The model's own processing profiles.\n\nDefault (standard): the strongest. Boosts local contrast and deepens\nlighting, and can oversaturate or look stylised -- most of what reads as\n'the model changed my game's look' is this profile.\n\nNatural: the same detail work with a gentler hand. Keeps skin tones and\ntonal balance closer to what the game rendered.\n\nCinematic: tones down the shine and over-processing for a film-like look.\n\nRead when the model is built, so a change rebuilds it after a moment. The\nnames come from community testing; NVIDIA ships no names in the binaries.", "模型内部的处理风格。\n默认（标准）：效果较强，增强局部对比与光照，也可能过饱和或改变游戏风格。\n自然：细节处理更柔和，肤色与明暗更接近游戏原始画面。\n电影：减弱过亮和过度处理，呈现电影感。\n修改后会重建模型。这些名称来自社区测试，NVIDIA 二进制文件没有提供对应名称。" },
{ "The model's own strength control, applied inside it. Distinct from detail\nstrength above, which scales the result afterwards.", "模型内部的强度参数，与效果合成阶段的“细节强度”不同。" },
{ "-1 means follow local structure, and is the model's own default -- it is not a\nstrength of zero. 0 and above set skin independently of the rest of the frame.", "-1 表示跟随“局部结构”，是模型默认值，不代表零强度。\n0 或正值会独立设置皮肤区域，不再跟随其他区域。" },
{ "The model was trained on finished, sRGB-encoded frames. The upscaler's\noutput is not one: it is linear and open-ended. These decide how it is\nmapped into something the model recognises. A frame the game reports as\nalready tone-mapped is passed over untouched and none of this applies.", "模型基于已完成色调映射的 sRGB 图像训练，而超分输出可能是线性 HDR。\n以下设置控制两者之间的映射。若游戏已完成色调映射，则直接传递，不应用这些设置。" },
{ "Where the number that divides the frame comes from.\n\nPaper white only -- the slider below and nothing else. Right for a\ngame whose exposure never moves, wrong the moment it does: one\nconstant cannot serve a cave and a field.\n\nThe game's own exposure -- read from the texture the game hands\nthe upscaler. The best source there is, because it is decided\nupstream and nothing this pass does can move it. Not every game\nsupplies one.\n\nA buffer the scan found -- for games that compute an exposure and\nnever pass it on. A GUESS: candidates are matched by shape, and in\nGTA V the best one tracks the real exposure but at its own scale,\nwhich the anchor's ratio cancels. Needs anchoring once, and checking\nafterwards.", "选择模型输入所用的白点来源。\n仅纸白值：只使用手动值，适用于曝光不变的游戏，无法同时适应洞穴和户外等明暗变化。\n游戏提供的曝光：优先使用游戏交给超分接口的曝光纹理，但并非所有游戏都提供。\n扫描缓冲区：按数据结构猜测曝光候选，必须先校准并检查随光照变化的读数；扫描匹配不代表一定识别正确。" },
{ "The white point for the selected calibration point, or -- with no row\nselected -- the value the next Anchor press captures.\n\nSet it until the picture looks right here, then Anchor. Move to very\ndifferent light and do it again: two points fix the buffer's real\nrelationship and the white point holds between them. Click a row below\nto come back and adjust that point; click it again to let go.", "选中校准行时，调整该点的白点值；未选中时，设置下一次校准将记录的值。\n在当前光照下调到画面正确，然后校准；移到明显不同的光照再校准一次。\n两个校准点可确定缓冲区与白点的关系。点击已有行可编辑，再次点击取消选择。" },
{ "A multiplier on the scan's white point, and the control you adjust between\nanchor points: dial it until the picture looks right in the current\nlight, then press Anchor here -- it captures the trimmed value as a new\npoint and resets the trim to 1.", "对扫描白点乘以微调倍率。\n在新的光照下调到画面正确，再点击“在此校准”记录为新点；校准后倍率重置为 1。" },
{ "A multiplier on the exposure the game supplied. 1.00x takes its number\nexactly, and that is the right answer here.\n\nThis is not a fudge factor. If a game needs the trim far from 1 to look\nright, that is evidence the exposure being read is wrong for that game,\nnot that the game wants trimming. Somewhere around 0.8 to 1.25 is honest\ntuning; reaching for 4 means something upstream is broken and the trim is\nhiding it.\n\nYour manual paper white is kept separately and comes back untouched if\nyou switch the option above off.", "对游戏曝光乘以微调倍率。1.00x 完全采用游戏提供的数值。\n通常仅需约 0.8–1.25 的细微调整；若必须调到 4 才正确，应检查曝光来源，而非用倍率掩盖问题。\n手动纸白值会单独保留，关闭自动来源后恢复。" },
{ "What the frame is divided by before the model sees it. There is no other white\npoint; this is the whole of it.\n\nThe model was trained on finished frames where white sits at 1. The\nupscaler's output is linear and open-ended, so something has to say where\nwhite is -- and where the game's DLSS buffer is linear HDR, that number is\nrarely anywhere near 1. Measured in Monster Hunter Wilds it takes 16 or more\nbefore the model's detail reaches the frame at all, and the value that suits\na shaded camp is still too small for the same game out in daylight.\n\nToo low and almost every pixel trips the soft knee: the model is shown a\nflat near-white picture, its answer is scaled away, and only its hue\nsurvives -- which reads as a colour cast rather than as lost detail. Too\nhigh and it is shown an underexposed one, its answer degrades, and this same\nnumber multiplies that error on the way out.\n\nRaise it until the picture stops improving. Past that point it does not\nplateau, it gets worse in the other direction.\n\nThis was once a multiplier on a measured white point. The measurement is\ngone: it read scene brightness rather than where white belongs, handed the\nmodel a picture three times too dark, and left the highlight path nothing to\ngive back.\n\nAt strength zero the frame is still bit-identical whatever this says.", "模型处理前，画面亮度将除以此白点值；模型训练时白点位于 1。\n线性 HDR 输出的正确白点通常远大于 1，并会随场景光照变化。\n过低会将大量像素压到近白色，丢失细节并产生色偏；过高会使模型输入欠曝，并放大还原误差。\n逐步提高直到画面不再改善，再回调；超过合适值后画面会变差。\n效果强度为 0 时，无论本项如何设置，原始画面仍逐字节保持不变。" },
{ "The most the pass may move any pixel, as a multiple of what it already was, in\nboth directions -- a pixel may not be brightened past this nor darkened past\nits reciprocal. Lights are where the model has least to say and rescaling its\nanswer does the most damage; 2x leaves detail intact while stopping a strip\nlight turning into a string of coloured cells. Raise it only if bright areas\nlook clipped.", "限制单个像素变亮或变暗的最大倍率；变暗下限为该倍率的倒数。\n2x 通常能保留细节，同时避免灯条变成彩色块。\n仅在高光看起来被截断时适当提高。" },
{ "A lamp in the corner: red for dark, green for full light, and the\nshades between, with the reading beside it.\n\nIt is how you see at a glance that the scan is TRACKING rather\nthan merely running. Walk into shade and it should slide toward\nred; step out and it should go green. If it moves the wrong way,\nthat is what the setting above is for.\n\nPurely a readout. It changes nothing.", "在屏幕角落显示光照读数：红色代表暗处，绿色代表明亮处。\n用于检查扫描是否真正跟随曝光变化。从阴影走到日光下，读数应由红转绿；反向变化时可使用反转设置。\n仅显示读数，不修改画面。" },
{ "Make the picture look right, then press this -- it captures the current look\nas a point. For the first point use the Paper white slider above; for\nevery point after, move to different light and use the Trim, which the\nAnchor then bakes into a new point.\n\nThe first press calibrates one point -- the white point then\nfollows the scan by ratio from there, as before. Walk into very\ndifferent light, set paper white again, and press it again: the\nsecond point pins down the buffer's real curve and everything\nbetween the two is right, not just near one anchor. Up to eight.\n\nThe table is per game and shareable: one person calibrates a game\nand the numbers are the same for everyone who takes the profile.", "先将画面调正确，再记录当前光照下的校准点。\n首个点使用“纸白值”，后续移动到不同光照，使用微调倍率，再记录新点。\n一个点按比例跟随扫描值；两个不同光照的点可确定实际关系，最多记录八个点。\n校准表按游戏保存，可与同一游戏的其他玩家共享。" },
{ "Flip this if the picture gets worse in the direction it should be\ngetting better. Most engines store an exposure that falls as\nthe scene brightens; some store its reciprocal, and a buffer\nfound by shape does not say which. Add a second anchor point in\ndifferent light and this is decided for you, so it disappears.", "若扫描数值变化方向与画面改善方向相反，请启用。\n多数引擎在场景变亮时降低曝光值，也有引擎使用其倒数；仅靠缓冲区结构无法确定。\n在不同光照下添加第二个校准点后，会自动确定方向并隐藏本项。" },
{ "Freezes the frame the model works on. While held, change paper white, the\nstrengths, the reversible mode, the model preset -- anything below the\nupscaler -- and only that setting moves; the scene does not.\n\nWhat it CANNOT show: DLSS/FSR/XeSS upscaler presets or anything upstream\n(the upscaler is not re-run on a held frame), and the game's own HUD and\npost-processing, which run after this pass and keep updating. The white\npoint stops being measured and holds its value while frozen, so it cannot\ndrift and confound the comparison.\n\nHide the menu and it stays held. Untoggle to resume.", "冻结模型处理的画面，方便调整纸白值、强度、可逆代理或模型预设，并比较同一帧。\n无法比较 DLSS / FSR / XeSS 的超分预设：超分不会在冻结帧上重新运行。\n游戏后续的 HUD 与后处理也仍会更新。冻结时白点保持不变。\n关闭菜单后仍冻结，取消本项即可恢复。" },
{ "Shows the pass against itself, so the two can be seen at once rather than\ntoggled and remembered.\n\nSide by side puts the whole frame in each half, untouched on the left and\nedited on the right. Both halves are squeezed horizontally to fit, so it is\nfor looking at rather than playing in.\n\nWipe cuts a single frame at the split and resamples nothing, so the picture\nis the right shape and can be played normally. Drag the split below; it is a\nstored setting and stays put once the menu is closed.\n\nNeither needs the menu open to keep working. A hairline marks the join.", "同时显示模型处理前后的效果。\n左右并排：两侧各显示完整画面，会水平压缩，适合观察，不适合正常游玩。\n划分对比：在同一帧中按分界显示两种效果，保持画面比例，可正常游玩。\n关闭菜单后仍继续显示，分界位置会保存。" },
{ "Writes which side is which onto the frame itself, so a screenshot still\nsays so after it has left this machine. Drawn into the picture's own\nplane: in the wipe the split reveals and hides the label exactly as it\ndoes the images, and there is nothing to drag. Swap sides moves the\nlabels with their pictures.", "在图像平面内标记两侧的含义，截图也会保留标签。\n划分对比会随分界遮挡或显示标签；交换左右时，标签随对应图像移动。" },
{ "Puts the edited frame on the other side.\n\nWorth doing once you have decided which you prefer: the eye is not\neven-handed about left and right, and a difference can read as an\nimprovement purely from where it sits. If the same side still wins after\nswapping, it is the pass you are seeing and not the placement.", "将模型处理后的画面换到另一侧。\n建议交换一次再判断，避免仅因左右位置差异误判画质。" },
{ "How much of the frame each half shows.\n\nA half is half as wide as the frame and just as tall, so the frame\ncannot fill it and keep its shape.\n\nAt 1 the whole frame is there at its right proportions, with bars above\nand below. At 2 the half is filled and the sides are cropped away\ninstead. Anything between trades one for the other.", "控制并排对比每侧显示的范围。\n1：按正确比例显示完整图像，上下留边；\n2：填满每侧区域，裁去图像左右部分；\n中间值在两者之间过渡。" },
{ "Where the wipe cuts. Left of it is the frame as the upscaler produced it,\nright of it is the frame the model edited.", "设置划分对比的分界。默认左侧为超分原始输出，右侧为模型处理后的画面。" },
{ "Proxy is the picture handed to the model -- if that looks wrong, the white point\nis wrong and nothing downstream can be judged.\n\nDifference shows what the model actually changed, amplified twenty times and\ncentred on grey. A flat grey frame there means it is doing nothing.", "代理图像是交给模型的实际输入；若其曝光不正确，应先调整白点。\n差异图将模型的修改放大 20 倍，并以灰色为中心；纯灰表示没有修改。" },
{ "Extended sliders limit for quality presets\n\nUsing this option changes resolution detection logic\nand might cause issues and crashes!", "扩展质量预设滑块的范围。\n会改变分辨率检测逻辑，可能产生兼容问题或崩溃！" },
{ "Can help with blurry textures in broken games\nNegative values will make textures sharper\nPositive values will make textures more blurry\n\nHas a small performance impact", "可改善部分游戏的纹理模糊。\n负值使纹理更锐利，正值使纹理更模糊。\n有少量性能开销。" },
{ "Controls the DXGI Present sync interval, which determines how\nthe swap chain waits for vertical refresh.\n\n0  = Present immediately, no VSync wait.\n1  = Sync to every refresh, normal VSync.\n2+ = Present every N refreshes, reducing effective frame rate.\n\nHigher values can reduce tearing but may increase latency and cap FPS.\nFor most games, use 0 for lowest latency or 1 for normal VSync.", "控制 DXGI Present 等待垂直刷新的间隔。\n0：立即呈现，不等待；1：每次刷新同步；2 或更高：每 N 次刷新呈现一次，限制有效帧率。\n较高值可减少撕裂，但可能增加延迟。通常使用 0 追求低延迟，或 1 使用常规垂直同步。" },
{ "Each render preset has it strengths and weaknesses\nOverride to potentially improve image quality\nPress apply after enable/disable", "不同渲染预设各有优劣，覆盖后可能改善画质。\n开关此功能后，请点击“应用更改”。" },
{ "Each render preset has it strengths and weaknesses\nOverride to potentially improve image quality\nPress Apply after enable/disable", "不同渲染预设各有优劣，覆盖后可能改善画质。\n开关此功能后，请点击“应用更改”。" },
{ "Click to open the OptiScaler Wiki page\nin your default browser\n\nCompatibility list with known game issues\nand workarounds, FG options explained\nand other useful info", "在默认浏览器中打开 OptiScaler Wiki。\n其中包括游戏兼容性、已知问题、解决方式及帧生成选项说明。" },
{ "Overrides every upscaler preset with the set value\n\n1.5x on a 1080p screen means an internal res of 720p\n1080 / 1.5 = 720", "用同一倍率覆盖全部超分预设。\n例如 1080p 屏幕设置 1.5x 时，内部渲染分辨率为 720p：1080 / 1.5 = 720。" },
{ "Lets you override each preset's ratio individually\nNote that not every game supports every quality preset\n\n1.5x on a 1080p screen means internal resolution of 720p\n1080 / 1.5 = 720", "分别覆盖各个质量预设的倍率，并非所有游戏都支持全部预设。\n例如 1080p 屏幕设置 1.5x 时，内部渲染分辨率为 720p。" },
{ "Upscales the image internally to a higher output resolution\nthen downscales it back to your display resolution\n\nValues <1.0 make the upscaler cheaper\nValues >1.0 make image sharper at the cost of performance\n\nIf greyed out, please check Git Wiki - Unreal Engine tweaks\n\nTarget res and total ratio at the bottom (max. total 3.0!)", "先缩放到内部输出分辨率，再降采样到显示分辨率。\n小于 1 可降低开销，大于 1 可改善清晰度，但增加开销。\n若选项灰色，请查看 Wiki 的虚幻引擎设置说明。\n底部显示目标分辨率和总倍率，总倍率上限为 3.0。" },
{ "Forces Borderless display mode\n\nFor best results, set fullscreen \nresolution to your display resolution\nMight cause some instability issues.\n\nNEEDS GAME RESTART TO BE ACTIVE!", "强制无边框显示模式。建议将全屏分辨率设为显示器分辨率。\n可能带来稳定性问题，需要重启游戏！" },
{ "Enable OptiScaler's sharpening filter\nBy default uses a sharpening value provided by the game\nSelect 'Override' under 'Sharpness' and adjust the slider\nto change it\n\nSome upscalers have their own sharpness filter, so this\noption is not always needed", "启用 OptiScaler 锐化滤镜，默认采用游戏提供的锐度。\n可启用“覆盖”后手动设置。部分超分实现自带锐化，此时不一定需要额外锐化。" },
{ "Use AMD's RCAS\nModified to add Contrast parameter\nand MAS support", "使用 AMD RCAS，并增加对比度参数与运动自适应锐化支持。" },
{ "Use Depth Aware Sharpening (RCAS)\nSmarter sharpening with less artifacts,\nbut also heavier\n\nThe farther away is the object, the more\nsharpening is applied", "使用深度感知 RCAS 锐化，减少边缘瑕疵，但开销更大。\n物体距离越远，应用的锐化越强。" },
{ "Use Depth Aware Sharpening (DAS)\nDepth-aware directional adaptive luma sharpener\nSmarter sharpening with less artifacts,\nbut also heavier\n\nThe farther away is the object, the more\nsharpening is applied", "使用深度感知、方向自适应亮度锐化，减少边缘瑕疵，但开销更大。\n物体距离越远，应用的锐化越强。" },
{ "Enable DA + MAS debug views\nBlue tint for DA detected edges\n\nMore red areas will have more sharpness applied\nGreen areas will get reduced sharpness", "显示深度与运动锐化调试视图。\n蓝色表示识别出的深度边缘；越红的区域锐化越强，绿色区域锐化减弱。" },
{ "Clamps the final image to the [0, 1] range.\n\nPrevents overshoot artifacts such as bright halos or negative colors.\nRecommended for LDR pipelines; optional for HDR depending on tone-mapping.\n\nWhen not set OptiScaler controls it via upscalers HDR flag", "将最终图像限制在 [0, 1]，避免亮边或负颜色等过冲。\n建议在 LDR 流程开启；HDR 视色调映射而定。\n未显式设置时，由超分辨率的 HDR 标记决定。" },
{ "Ignores small depth differences before edge detection.\n\nHigher values reduce flickering and noise from minor depth changes, but may soften real geometry edges.\nLower values preserve fine detail but can cause unstable or noisy edge detection.", "边缘检测前忽略较小的深度差。\n高值可减少闪烁和噪点，但可能使真实几何边缘变软；低值保留细节，但可能不稳定。" },
{ "Controls how strongly sharpening is reduced across depth edges.\n\nHigher values more aggressively prevent sharpening across object boundaries (reduces halos).\nLower values allow more sharpening to pass across edges (sharper but riskier).", "控制跨深度边缘时削弱锐化的程度。\n较高值可减少物体边缘光晕；较低值更锐利，但风险也更高。" },
{ "Positive values decrease sharpness at high contrast areas.\nNegative values increase sharpness at high contrast areas.", "正值降低高对比度区域的锐度；负值提高这些区域的锐度。" },
{ "Areas that are more red will have more sharpness applied\nGreen areas will get reduced sharpness", "越红的区域锐化越强，绿色区域锐化减弱。" },
{ "Maximum amount of sharpness that motion can add or remove.\n\nNegative values reduce sharpening in motion (recommended).\nPositive values increase sharpening in motion.\n\nThe final adjustment scales with motion and is capped at this value.", "运动能增加或减少的最大锐度。\n推荐负值以在运动中降低锐化；正值会增加运动中的锐度。\n最终调整随运动量变化，并受本值限制。" },
{ "Minimum motion required before motion-based sharpening adjustment begins.\n\nHigher values ignore small movements (more stable).\nLower values react to subtle motion (more sensitive).", "开始运动锐化调整的最小运动量。\n高值忽略细微移动，更稳定；低值更敏感。" },
{ "Defines the motion range over which the effect ramps from zero to full strength.\n\nValues above the threshold are mapped into this range.\nLarger values make the response smoother and more gradual.\nSmaller values make the effect react more quickly and aggressively.", "设置效果从零逐步增加到完整强度的运动范围。\n超过阈值的运动映射到该范围；范围越大越平滑，越小反应越快。" },
{ "Some Unreal Engine games need this\n\nTry using if colours flickering or\nobjects have ghosting trails", "部分虚幻引擎游戏需要此选项。\n若颜色闪烁或物体有拖影，可尝试开启。" },
{ "Allows the use of a Reactive mask\nKeep in mind that a Reactive mask sent to DLSS\nwill not produce a good image in combination with FSR/XeSS", "控制反应性遮罩的使用。\n注意：游戏为 DLSS 提供的反应性遮罩，交给 FSR / XeSS 时可能导致画质问题。" },
{ "Mostly a fix for Unreal Engine games\nTop left part of the screen will be blurry", "主要用于虚幻引擎游戏的兼容修复。\n可修复画面左上区域模糊的问题。" },
{ "By default, FSR Anti-Lag 2.0/XeLL is used when available.\nThis setting lets you force LatencyFlex instead", "默认优先使用可用的 FSR Anti-Lag 2.0 / XeLL。\n此选项会强制改用 LatencyFlex。" },
{ "Allows XeLL to work without FG on non-Intel cards.\n\nDisables FG options\n\nRequires a restart", "允许非 Intel 显卡在未开启帧生成时使用 XeLL。\n会禁用帧生成选项，需要重启游戏。" },
{ "The safest, but might not reduce latency well", "最保守的方式，但降低延迟的效果可能有限。" },
{ "Improves latency, but in some cases will lower FPS more than expected", "可改善延迟，但部分情况下帧率下降可能超过预期。" },
{ "Best when can be used, some games are not compatible (e.g. Cyberpunk)\nand will fallback to Aggressive", "兼容时通常效果最佳，部分游戏（如赛博朋克）不兼容时会回退到激进模式。" },
{ "Always track resources, might cause performance issues\n, but also might fix HUDFix related crashes!", "始终跟踪资源，可能降低性能，但也可能修复 HUD 修复相关的崩溃。" },
{ "Block rarely used resources from using as HUDless \nto prevent flickers and other issues\n\nHUDfix enable/disable will reset the block list!", "排除不常用的无 HUD 候选，避免闪烁等问题。\n开关 HUD 修复会清空排除列表！" },
{ "Corresponds to amount of accumulation added per frame\nat pixel coordinate where disocclusion occured or when\nreactive mask value is > 0.0f. Decreasing this and \ndrawing the ghosting object (IE no mv) to reactive mask \nwith value close to 1.0f can decrease temporal ghosting.\nDecreasing this could result in more thin feature pixels flickering.", "控制每帧对解除遮挡或反应性遮罩大于 0 的像素增加的累积量。\n减小数值，并将无运动矢量的拖影对象以接近 1 的值写入反应性遮罩，可减少时序拖影。\n过低可能增加细小物体的像素闪烁。" },
{ "Each internal FSR4 preset is tuned for a specific resolution.\nSelecting an FSR4 preset won't change the in-game\nupscaler preset!!!\n\nPreset 0 is meant for FSR Native AA\nPreset 1 is meant for Quality/Ultra Quality\nPreset 2 is meant for Balanced\nPreset 3 is meant for Performance\nPreset 4 is meant for DRS\nPreset 5 is meant for Ultra Performance", "每个 FSR4 内部预设针对不同分辨率调校，本项不会改变游戏中的超分质量预设。\n0：原生抗锯齿；1：质量 / 超高质量；2：平衡；3：性能；4：动态分辨率；5：超级性能。" },
{ "Enable FSR3.1-FG Debug view\n\nTop left: Game Motion Vectors\nTop middle: GMV Depth\nTop right: Optical Flow MV\nMiddle: Interpolated frame only\nBottom left: Disocclusion mask\nBottom middle: Interpolation source (w/o UI)\nBottom right: HUDless resource", "启用 FSR3.1 帧生成调试视图。\n左上：游戏运动矢量；中上：运动矢量深度；右上：光流矢量。\n中间：插入帧；左下：解除遮挡遮罩；中下：不含 UI 的插帧来源；右下：无 HUD 资源。" },
{ "Enables capturing of resources before shader execution.\nIncrease HUDless capture chances, but might cause capturing of unnecessary resources.", "在着色器执行前捕获资源，可提高无 HUD 捕获机会，但也可能捕获不需要的资源。" },
{ "Extended format checks for possible HUDless\nMight cause crashes and slowdowns!", "扩展无 HUD 候选的格式检查，可能导致崩溃或性能下降！" },
{ "How long to spin if FPTHybridSpin is true. Measured in timer resolution units.\nNot recommended to go below 2. Will result in frequent overshoots", "混合自旋的持续时间，以计时器分辨率为单位。\n不建议低于 2，否则可能频繁错过预定时间。" },
{ "If you are using an AMD/Intel GPU, then make sure you have Fakenvapi", "使用 AMD / Intel 显卡时，请确认已安装 Fakenvapi。" },
{ "If you are using an AMD/Intel GPU, then make sure you have fakenvapi", "使用 AMD / Intel 显卡时，请确认已安装 Fakenvapi。" },
{ "Increasing this scales FSR3.1 computed shading\nchange value at read to have higher reactiveness.", "放大 FSR3.1 计算的着色变化值，提高反应程度。" },
{ "Increasing this value may reduce white pixel temporal\nflickering around swaying thin objects that are disoccluding \none another often. Too high value may increase ghosting.", "提高此值可减少细小物体互相遮挡时的白色像素闪烁，但过高会增加拖影。" },
{ "Make a copy of depth to use with OptiFG\nFor preventing corruptions that might happen", "为 OptiFG 复制深度，避免资源被修改造成的画面异常。" },
{ "Make a copy of motion vectors to use with OptiFG\nFor preventing corruptions that might happen", "为 OptiFG 复制运动矢量，避免资源被修改造成的画面异常。" },
{ "Makes a copy of the depth buffer\nCan fix broken visuals in some games on AMD GPUs under Windows\nCan cause stutters, so best to use only when necessary", "复制深度缓冲，可修复 Windows 下部分 AMD 显卡游戏的画面异常。\n可能产生卡顿，仅在需要时启用。" },
{ "Meant for development purpose to test if\nwriting a larger value to reactive mask, reduces ghosting.", "用于开发测试：检查增加反应性遮罩值是否能减少拖影。" },
{ "Might be required for some sets of DispatchFlags", "部分 DispatchFlags 组合可能需要此项。" },
{ "Relax resolution checks for HUDless by 32 pixels \nHelps games which use black borders for some \nresolutions and screen ratios (e.g. Witcher 3)", "将无 HUD 候选的分辨率检查放宽 32 像素，可适配使用黑边的分辨率或屏幕比例，例如巫师 3。" },
{ "Required for Debug flags to work correctly", "调试标记需要启用此项才能正确生效。" },
{ "Safety margins in millisecons\nFSR default value: 0.1ms\nOpti default value: 0.01ms", "安全余量，单位毫秒。\nFSR 默认：0.1 ms；Opti 默认：0.01 ms。" },
{ "Top left: Dilated Motion Vectors\nTop middle: Protected Areas\nTop right: Dilated Depth\nMiddle: Upscaled frame\nBottom left: Disocclusion mask\nBottom middle: Reactiveness\nBottom right: Detail Protection Takedown", "左上：膨胀运动矢量；中上：保护区域；右上：膨胀深度。\n中间：超分图像。\n左下：解除遮挡遮罩；中下：反应性；右下：细节保护抑制。" },
{ "Top left: Dilated Motion Vectors\nTop right: Predicted Blend Factor", "左上：膨胀运动矢量；右上：预测混合系数。" },
{ "Value of 0.0f can improve temporal stability of bright pixels\nLower values are more stable with ghosting\nHigher values are more pixelly, but less ghosting", "0 可改善明亮像素的时序稳定性。\n较低值更稳定，但拖影较多；较高值更像素化，但拖影较少。" },
{ "Variance factor\nFSR default value: 0.1\nOpti default value: 0.3", "方差系数。\nFSR 默认：0.1；Opti 默认：0.3。" },
{ "FSR Anti-Lag 2.0 is the new name for AntiLag 2\nDon't ask me why", "FSR Anti-Lag 2.0 是 AntiLag 2 的新名称。" },
{ "Intended for Performance/Balanced/Quality modes.\nAn older variant best suited to combat ghosting...\nRemoved on recent versions!", "用于性能 / 平衡 / 质量模式的旧预设，侧重减少拖影。\n新版 DLSS 已移除此预设！" },
{ "Intended for Ultra Performance mode.\nSimilar to Preset A...\nRemoved on recent versions!", "用于超级性能模式，与预设 A 类似。\n新版 DLSS 已移除此预设！" },
{ "Intended for Performance/Balanced/Quality modes.\nGenerally favors current frame information...\nRemoved on recent versions!", "用于性能 / 平衡 / 质量模式，更倾向采用当前帧信息。\n新版 DLSS 已移除此预设！" },
{ "Default preset for Performance/Balanced/Quality modes;\ngenerally favors image stability.\nRemoved on recent versions!", "性能 / 平衡 / 质量模式的旧默认预设，倾向保持图像稳定。\n新版 DLSS 已移除此预设！" },
{ "DLSS 3.7+, a better D preset\nRemoved on recent versions!", "DLSS 3.7 起提供的改进版预设 D。\n新版 DLSS 已移除此预设！" },
{ "Default preset for Ultra Performance and DLAA modes\nRemoved on recent versions!", "超级性能与 DLAA 模式的旧默认预设。\n新版 DLSS 已移除此预设！" },
{ "Similar to preset K. Preset J might exhibit slightly\nless ghosting...\n1st Gen Transformer", "与预设 K 类似，可能有稍少的拖影。\n第一代 Transformer。" },
{ "Default preset for DLAA/Balanced/Quality modes...\n1st Gen Transformer", "DLAA / 平衡 / 质量模式的默认预设。\n第一代 Transformer。" },
{ "Default for Ultra Perf mode\n2nd Gen Transformers", "超级性能模式的默认预设。\n第二代 Transformer。" },
{ "Default for Perf mode\n2nd Gen Transformer", "性能模式的默认预设。\n第二代 Transformer。" },
{ "Latest Transformer model\nMust use if DoF guide is needed", "最新 Transformer 模型，使用景深引导时必须选择。" },
{ "Consider renaming OptiScaler from %s to other supported name.\nYou may experience issues otherwise.", "当前名为 %s 的 OptiScaler 可能过晚安装 Hook。\n上游建议换用其他受支持名称，否则可能出现问题；SSMT 用户应通过插件更新处理。" },
{ "Upscaler must be enabled\n\nCan be used with any FG Output, but might be imperfect with some\nTo prevent UI glitching, HUDfix required", "需要启用超分辨率。\n可与任意帧生成输出组合，但部分组合可能有瑕疵。\n避免 UI 异常需要启用 HUD 修复。" },
{ "Can be used with any FG Output\n\nRequires enabling DLSS-FG in game settings\nSupports HUDless out of the box\n\nLimited to games that use Streamline", "可与任意帧生成输出组合。\n需要在游戏中启用 DLSS 帧生成，原生提供无 HUD 输入。\n仅限使用 Streamline 的游戏。" },
{ "Limited to variants of FSR FG\n\nRequires enabling DLSS-FG in game settings\nSupports HUDless out of the box\nUses Streamline swapchain for pacing", "仅支持 FSR 帧生成变体。\n需要在游戏中启用 DLSS 帧生成，原生提供无 HUD 输入，并通过 Streamline 交换链控制帧步调。" },
{ "Can be used with any FG Output\n\nRequires enabling FSR-FG in game settings\nSupports HUDless out of the box", "可与任意帧生成输出组合。\n需要在游戏中启用 FSR 帧生成，原生提供无 HUD 输入。" },
{ "Support not implemented, they meant FG Output", "尚未实现输入支持；请将其用作帧生成输出。" },
{ "FSR3/4-FG, RDNA4 autoupgrades to FSR4-FG\n\nFSR4-FG sometimes better/worse than XeFG", "FSR3 / FSR4 帧生成，RDNA4 会自动升级为 FSR4。\n与 XeFG 相比，效果因游戏而异。" },
{ "DLSSG output\ncan be used in conjuction with Nukem's for example", "DLSSG 输出，可与 Nukem 等替代实现组合。" },
{ "XeFG - heaviest, but best universal FG\n\nXeFG 3 overall deals best with HUD\n\nEnable UI Composition if HUD ghosting", "XeFG 的开销较大，但通用兼容性较好；XeFG 3 对 HUD 的处理通常更好。\n若 HUD 有拖影，请尝试启用 UI 合成。" },
{ "FFX for the middle fake frame, Enabler for the rest\n\n2x - FFX\n3x - Enabler\n4x - FFX + Enabler\n5x - Enabler\n6x - FFX + Enabler", "中间插入帧由 FFX 生成，其余由 Enabler 生成。\n2x：FFX；3x：Enabler；4x：FFX + Enabler；5x：Enabler；6x：FFX + Enabler。" },
{ "FFX for middle fake frames, and Enabler for the rest\n\n2x - FFX\n3x - Enabler\n4x - FFX + Enabler\n5x - Enabler\n6x - FFX + Enabler", "中间插入帧由 FFX 生成，其余由 Enabler 生成。\n2x：FFX；3x：Enabler；4x：FFX + Enabler；5x：Enabler；6x：FFX + Enabler。" },
{ "Missing amd_fidelityfx_framegeneration_dx12.dll\nor missing dlss-enabler-headless.dll", "缺少 amd_fidelityfx_framegeneration_dx12.dll 或 dlss-enabler-headless.dll。" },
{ "Enable temporal HUD pinning (present-backbuffer stability)", "启用时序固定 HUD，改善呈现后备缓冲的稳定性。" },
{ "Use HUD-less as UI mask (DL2 inverted semantics)", "将无 HUD 资源用作 UI 遮罩（DL2 反向语义）。" },
{ "HUD OF interpolation (0=legacy pin-present, 1=OF warp)", "HUD 光流插帧：0 为旧版固定呈现，1 为光流变形。" },
{ "Ignore dedicated DLSSG.UI texture (force legacy HUD path)", "忽略独立 DLSSG.UI 纹理，强制使用旧 HUD 路径。" },
{ "OF pipeline using dp4a-accelerated SSD (SM 6.4+)", "光流流程使用 DP4a 加速的 SSD（需要 SM 6.4 或更新）。" },
{ "Pin DLSSG.Backbuffer to subframe-1 snapshot across MFG frame", "在多帧生成期间，将 DLSSG.Backbuffer 固定为第一个子帧的快照。" },
{ "Debug: blue tint where camera MV fallback is used", "以蓝色标记使用相机运动矢量回退的区域。" },
{ "Uses Reflex when possible\nOn AMD/Intel cards, you can use Fakenvapi to substitute Reflex", "尽可能使用 Reflex。AMD / Intel 显卡可用 Fakenvapi 替代 Reflex。" },
{ "Using RTSS Reflex injection with FSR Anti-Lag 2.0 and FSR FG might cause issues", "RTSS Reflex 注入与 FSR Anti-Lag 2.0、FSR 帧生成同时使用可能产生问题。" },
{ "Using Reflex's limit with FSR FG has performance overhead", "Reflex 帧率限制与 FSR 帧生成组合会带来额外开销。" },
{ "Default option.\nGood enough image quality and very fast.", "默认选项，画质较好且速度快。" },
{ "Fastest traditional option.\nProduces a very soft/blurry image, but might be okay for downscaling.", "速度最快的传统算法，画面较柔和或模糊，但可用于降采样。" },
{ "Designed primarily for downscaling.\nRetains good contrast with minimal artefacts, but softer than Lanczos.", "主要针对降采样，保留较好对比度，瑕疵较少，但比 Lanczos 更柔和。" },
{ "Lighter and faster than Lanczos3.\nLess prone to ringing artefacts, but slightly blurrier.", "比 Lanczos3 更轻、更快，振铃较少，但稍模糊。" },
{ "Heavier version of Lanczos2.\nOffers the sharpest image, but is the most prone to ringing.\nConsidered the best along with Kaiser3.", "比 Lanczos2 开销更大，画面最锐利，但更容易出现振铃。\n与 Kaiser3 一起被视为较好的选择。" },
{ "Similar to Lanczos2.\nSmoother and less prone to artefacts than Lanczos, but slightly blurrier.", "与 Lanczos2 类似，更平滑、瑕疵更少，但稍模糊。" },
{ "Similar to Lanczos3.\nFar less prone to artefacting than Lanczos3, but much heavier on the GPU.\nConsidered the best along with Lanczos3.", "与 Lanczos3 类似，振铃明显更少，但 GPU 开销大得多。\n与 Lanczos3 一起被视为较好的选择。" },
{ "Specialised to prevent artifacts.\nEliminates harsh halos for a natural look, but can appear slightly soft.", "针对避免瑕疵优化，消除明显光晕，效果自然，但可能略柔和。" },
{ "Only FSR1 and Bicubic are supported when Ratio is below 1.0.", "倍率小于 1.0 时，仅支持 FSR1 与 Bicubic。" },
